{"id":"240580939d1fd13a","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-reach-a-p-complete.md","title":"REACH a P完全","display":"thm-reach-a-p-complete — REACH_a P完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-reach-a-p-complete","aliases":["29-thm-reach-a-p-complete"],"display":"thm-reach-a-p-complete — REACH_a P完全","depends_on":["[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","[[29-df-alternating-reachability]]","[[29-df-many-one-reduction]]","[[29-df-completeness]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem3.26, p.54, scan69"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-reach-a-p-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-reach-a-p-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-reach-a-p-complete — REACH_a P完全"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ecf0316ce54c8b96\" href=\"?note=ecf0316ce54c8b96\" title=\"29-df-alternating-reachability\">29-df-alternating-reachability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2005f7c77a4cbc08\" href=\"?note=2005f7c77a4cbc08\" title=\"29-df-many-one-reduction\">29-df-many-one-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5da52cc2e80d709c\" href=\"?note=5da52cc2e80d709c\" title=\"29-df-completeness\">29-df-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem3.26, p.54, scan69"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}}\">\\(\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a>，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65b448b4269ca18e\" href=\"?note=65b448b4269ca18e\" title=\"29-df-first-order-reduction\">29-df-first-order-reduction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5da52cc2e80d709c\" href=\"?note=5da52cc2e80d709c\" title=\"29-df-completeness\">29-df-completeness</a>；目标查询为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}}\">\\(\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}}\\)</span>，由对应问题定义的显式结构版本给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Complete}(\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}},\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}},\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem3.26, p.54, scan69。本条恢复原书Provisos1.14–1.15的输入范围，不对任意无序非空结构宣称同一弱归约完全性。原书使用交替对数空间等于P并构造交替配置图；本次核对来源陈述与构造结构，未逐式完成全部FO编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-alternating-reachability","status":"resolved","id":"ecf0316ce54c8b96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-alternating-reachability]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-many-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"2005f7c77a4cbc08","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-many-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"5da52cc2e80d709c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 与 $\\mathrm{P}_{\\mathrm{std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-standard-inputs]]，词汇包含标准数值关系且域至少两个元素。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"65b448b4269ca18e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_{\\mathrm{fo,std}}$ 使用 [[29-df-f